## Implementation under `apps/good-recording/`

The Swift implementation of feature `001-good-recording` lives in
this same repo at `apps/good-recording/`. When asked to modify
implementation code, scripts (build / sign / make-cert /
rebuild-and-reauth), or `project.yml`, work there.

Key implementation files:

- [`apps/good-recording/project.yml`](mdc:apps/good-recording/project.yml) — XcodeGen source of truth (do NOT use `info:` / `entitlements:` keys; see troubleshooting Issue 2)
- [`apps/good-recording/Sources/App/`](mdc:apps/good-recording/Sources/App) — `App.swift`, `AppDelegate.swift`, `FeatureFlags.swift`, `MainWindow.swift`
- [`apps/good-recording/Sources/Features/US1-Recording/`](mdc:apps/good-recording/Sources/Features/US1-Recording) — done (T030–T047)
- `apps/good-recording/Sources/Features/US2-ScopeSelection/` — pending (T048–T063)
- `apps/good-recording/Sources/Features/US3-AudioSources/` — pending (T064–T079)
- `apps/good-recording/Sources/Features/US4-QualitySettings/` — pending (T080–T093)
- `apps/good-recording/Sources/Features/US5-AudioOnlyMode/` — pending (T094–T103)
- [`apps/good-recording/Sources/Core/`](mdc:apps/good-recording/Sources/Core) — Capture, Encoding, Storage, Permissions, Hotkey, Notifications, Logging (Phase 2)
- [`apps/good-recording/Tests/`](mdc:apps/good-recording/Tests) — UnitTests, IntegrationTests, UITests
- [`apps/good-recording/scripts/`](mdc:apps/good-recording/scripts) — setup-xcode, make-local-cert, build-universal, sign-and-notarize, rebuild-and-reauth, plus `ci/` lint scripts

## Live v0.1 known limitation

`AudioMixer.useEnginePath = false` — v0.2 AVAudioEngine real-mix
path is written but has an unsolved buffer-drop issue. Default
preset is `.sysOnly` until v0.2 mixer is fixed (see
`apps/good-recording/Sources/Core/Encoding/AudioMixer.swift`
"KNOWN ISSUE" comment).
